body:
really good app for me, it works and has cute graphics. very motivating and i think it was worth my £1.99. 
i would recommend using particularly for studying on the mode where leaving the app kills the tree, and for other productive tasks or even sleeping !
let’s be real, none of us have self control :’)

This app helps me so much when I need to study - I easily get distracted by social media and it’s definitely worth getting as there’s that feeling that you don’t want to kill the tree! 
You can also be productive to plant real trees in Africa and help the earth which I think is great! 

